# Packages of the box image that the software box leaves out.
# One package per line; the text after the name says why.

chromium-browser            not packaged under this name for Debian on x86; screens are not simulated
python3-libcamera           not packaged for Debian on x86; cameras are not simulated
firefox-esr                 screens are not simulated
lightdm                     screens are not simulated
openbox                     screens are not simulated
unclutter                   screens are not simulated
x11-utils                   screens are not simulated
xdotool                     screens are not simulated
xinput                      screens are not simulated
xserver-xorg-input-evdev    screens are not simulated
xserver-xorg-video-dummy    screens are not simulated
xserver-xorg-video-fbdev    screens are not simulated
dbus-x11                    screens are not simulated
fswebcam                    cameras are not simulated
hostapd                     Wi-Fi and the access point are not simulated
dnsmasq                     Wi-Fi and the access point are not simulated
iw                          Wi-Fi and the access point are not simulated
printer-driver-all          drivers of real printers; the print queues of the software box are raw
console-data                keyboard maps of the console; the container has no console
kpartx                      tool of the image build and of the card upgrade
localepurge                 tool of the image build
screen                      operator tool
vim                         operator tool
